<title>USA: HomeLife buys 100 realty offices.</title>
<headline>HomeLife buys 100 realty offices.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>HomeLife Inc Tuesday said it acquired, for cash and stock, approximately 100 realty offices located in the Midwest, West and Southwest, from Utah-based S&amp;S Acquisition Corp.</p>
<p>In a statement, HomeLife said the realty offices currently operate under the National Real Estate Service or Red Carpet banners.</p>
<p>The company said the newly acquired offices can choose to operate as they are, or as HomeLife offices.</p>
